From 2c5ed87e2690cc4bbad24bf6034041c93fc6627d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Ding <yi.s.ding@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 23:45:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 12/28] fix rkmpp/rkrga/v4l2 code review findings

- hwcontext_rkmpp: size pool buffers from the exported plane layout so
  NV15/NV20 pitches cannot overflow the dma-buf
- rkmppdec: surface fatal put_packet errors instead of EAGAIN livelock,
  negotiate via get_format when pix_fmt is unset, guard last_pts against
  AV_NOPTS_VALUE after flush, export errinfo frames flagged as corrupt
- rkmppenc: gate rc fps on a valid framerate, restore encoder flush
  capability, propagate real submit_frame error codes
- rkrga_common: add scheduler_core > 0 guard to is_rga2_used, propagate
  pat preproc hwframes init failure
- vf_vpp_rkrga/vf_overlay_rkrga: propagate EOF drain errors
- v4l2: make explicit -channel S_INPUT failures fatal, prefer user
  framerate over DV-timings estimate

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
